{"id":"torrey:christ-character-of","source":"torrey","name":"Christ, Character Of","slug":"christ-character-of","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Altogether lovely — Song 5:16.","refs":[["Song",5,16,5,16]]},{"text":"Holy — Lu 1:35; Ac 4:27; Re 3:7.","refs":[["Luke",1,35,1,35],["Acts",4,27,4,27],["Rev",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"Righteous — Isa 53:11; Heb 1:9.","refs":[["Isa",53,11,53,11],["Heb",1,9,1,9]]},{"text":"Good — Mt 19:16.","refs":[["Matt",19,16,19,16]]},{"text":"Faithful — Isa 11:5; 1Th 5:24.","refs":[["Isa",11,5,11,5],["1Thess",5,24,5,24]]},{"text":"True — Joh 1:14; 7:18; 1Jo 5:20.","refs":[["John",1,14,1,14],["John",7,18,7,18],["1John",5,20,5,20]]},{"text":"Just — Zec 9:9; Joh 5:30; Ac 22:14.","refs":[["Zech",9,9,9,9],["John",5,30,5,30],["Acts",22,14,22,14]]},{"text":"Guileless — Isa 53:9; 1Pe 2:22.","refs":[["Isa",53,9,53,9],["1Pet",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"Sinless — Joh 8:46; 2Co 5:21.","refs":[["John",8,46,8,46],["2Cor",5,21,5,21]]},{"text":"Spotless — 1Pe 1:19.","refs":[["1Pet",1,19,1,19]]},{"text":"Innocent — Mt 27:4.","refs":[["Matt",27,4,27,4]]},{"text":"Harmless — Heb 7:26.","refs":[["Heb",7,26,7,26]]},{"text":"Resisting temptation — Mt 4:1-10.","refs":[["Matt",4,1,4,10]]},{"text":"Obedient to God the Father — Ps 40:8; Joh 4:34; 15:10.","refs":[["Ps",40,8,40,8],["John",4,34,4,34],["John",15,10,15,10]]},{"text":"Zealous — Lu 2:49; Joh 2:17; 8:29.","refs":[["Luke",2,49,2,49],["John",2,17,2,17],["John",8,29,8,29]]},{"text":"Meek — Isa 53:7; Zec 9:9; Mt 11:29.","refs":[["Isa",53,7,53,7],["Zech",9,9,9,9],["Matt",11,29,11,29]]},{"text":"Lowly in heart — Mt 11:29.","refs":[["Matt",11,29,11,29]]},{"text":"Merciful — Heb 2:17.","refs":[["Heb",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"Patient — Isa 53:7; Mt 27:14.","refs":[["Isa",53,7,53,7],["Matt",27,14,27,14]]},{"text":"Long-suffering — 1Ti 1:16.","refs":[["1Tim",1,16,1,16]]},{"text":"Compassionate — Isa 40:11; Lu 19:41.","refs":[["Isa",40,11,40,11],["Luke",19,41,19,41]]},{"text":"Benevolent — Mt 4:23,24; Ac 10:38.","refs":[["Matt",4,2