,{"text":"As the Eternal God and Creator — Ps 102:24-27; Heb 1:8,10-12.","refs":[["Ps",102,24,102,27],["Heb",1,8,1,8],["Heb",1,10,1,12]]},{"text":"As the mighty God — Isa 9:6.","refs":[["Isa",9,6,9,6]]},{"text":"As the Great God and Saviour — Ho 1:7; Tit 2:13.","refs":[["Hos",1,7,1,7],["Titus",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"As God over all — Ps 45:6,7; Ro 9:5.","refs":[["Ps",45,6,45,6],["Ps",45,7,45,7],["Rom",9,5,9,5]]},{"text":"As the true God — Jer 10:10; 1Jo 5:20.","refs":[["Jer",10,10,10,10],["1John",5,20,5,20]]},{"text":"As God the Word — Joh 1:1.","refs":[["John",1,1,1,1]]},{"text":"As God, the judge — Ec 12:14; 1Co 4:5; 2Co 5:10; 2Ti 4:1.","refs":[["Eccl",12,14,12,14],["1Cor",4,5,4,5],["2Cor",5,10,5,10],["2Tim",4,1,4,1]]},{"text":"As Emmanuel — Isa 7:14; Mt 1:23.","refs":[["Isa",7,14,7,14],["Matt",1,23,1,23]]},{"text":"As King of kings and Lord of lords — Da 10:17; Re 1:5; 17:14.","refs":[["Dan",10,17,10,17],["Rev",1,5,1,5],["Rev",17,14,17,14]]},{"text":"As the Holy One — 1Sa 2:2; Ac 3:14.","refs":[["1Sam",2,2,2,2],["Acts",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"As the Lord from heaven — 1Co 15:47.","refs":[["1Cor",15,47,15,47]]},{"text":"As Lord of the Sabbath — Ge 2:3; Mt 12:8.","refs":[["Gen",2,3,2,3],["Matt",12,8,12,8]]},{"text":"As Lord of all — Ac 10:36; Ro 10:11-13.","refs":[["Acts",10,36,10,36],["Rom",10,11,10,13]]},{"text":"As Son of God — Mt 26:63-67.","refs":[["Matt",26,63,26,67]]},{"text":"As the Only-begotten Son of the Father — Joh 1:14,18; 3:16,18; 1Jo 4:9.","refs":[["John",1,14,1,14],["John",1,18,1,18],["John",3,16,3,16],["John",3,18,3,18],["1John",4,9,4,9]]},{"text":"His blood is called the blood of God — Ac 20:28.","refs":[["Acts",20,28,20,28]]},{"text":"As one with the Father — Joh 10:30,38; 12:45; 14:7-10; 17:10.","refs":[["John",10,30,10,30],["John",10,38,10,38],["John",12,45,12,45],["John",14,7,14,10],["John",17,10,17,10]]},{"text":"As sending the Spirit, equally with the Father — Joh 14:16; 15:26.","refs":[["John",14,16,14,16],["John",15,26,15,26]]},{"text":"As entitled to equal honour with the Father — Joh 5:23.","refs":[["John",5,23,5,23]]},{"text":"As Owner of all things, equally with the Father — Joh 16:15.","refs":[["John",16,15,16,15]]},{"text":"As unrestricted by the law of the sabbath, equally with the Father — Joh 5:17.","refs":[["John",5,17,5,17]]},{"text":"As the Source of grace, equally with the Father — 1Th 3:11; 2Th 2:16,17.","refs":[["1Thess",3,11,3,11],["2Thess",2,16,2,16],["2Thess",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"As unsearchable, equally with the Father — Pr 30:4; Mt 11:27.","refs":[["Prov",30,4,30,4],["Matt",11,27,11,27]]},{"text":"As Creator of all things — Isa 40:28; Joh 1:3; Col 1:16; Heb 1:2.","refs":[["Isa",40,28,40,28],["John",1,3,1,3],["Col",1,16,1,16],["Heb",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"As Supporter and Preserver of all things — Ne 9:6; Col 1:17; Heb 1:3.","refs":[["Neh",9,6,9,6],["Col",1,17,1,17],["Heb",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"As possessed of the fulness of the God head — Col 2:9; Heb 1:3.","refs":[["Col",2,9,2,9],["Heb",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"As raising the dead — Joh 5:21; 6:40,54.","refs":[["John",5,21,5,21],["John",6,40,6,40],["John",6,54,6,54]]},{"text":"As raising himself from the dead — Joh 2:19,21; 10:18.","refs":[["John",2,19,2,19],["John",2,21,2,21],["John",10,18,10,18]]},{"text":"As Eternal — Isa 9:6; Mic 5:2; Joh 1:1; Col 1:17; Heb 1:8-10; Re 1:8.","refs":[["Isa",9,6,9,6],["Mic",5,2,5,2],["John",1,1,1,1],["Col",1,17,1,17],["Heb",1,8,1,10],["Rev",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"As Omnipresent — Mt 18:20; 28:20; Joh 3:13.","refs":[["Matt",18,20,18,20],["Matt",28,20,28,20],["John",3,13,3,13]]},{"text":"As Omnipotent — Ps 45:3; Php 3:21; Re 1:8.","refs":[["Ps",45,3,45,3],["Phil",3,21,3,21],["Rev",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"As Omniscient — Joh 16:30; 21:17.","refs":[["John",16,30,16,30],["John",21,17,21,17]]},{"text":"As discerning the thoughts of the heart — 1Ki 8:39; Lu 5:22; Eze 11:5; Joh 2:24,25; Re 2:23.","refs":[["1Kgs",8,39,8,39],["Luke",5,22,5,22],["Ezek",11,5,11,5],["John",2,24,2,24],["John",2,25,2,25],["Rev",2,23,2,23]]},{"t